WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.680
I just, I want that to sit in right now

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:04.600
because the president of the United States of America

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:07.840
has declared war on the people of Chicago

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.660
and people across America.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:11.580
We don't want a rematch.

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.620
The president hasn't declared war on anyone,

00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:17.520
but they've declared him public enemy number one.

